title: "DRerio LogAI"
version: 6.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-15
abstract: "An open-source, GPU-free platform for automated tracking, closed-loop stimulation and behavioural analysis of adult zebrafish (Danio rerio), combining YOLOv11 detection, BYTETracker multi-object tracking and Intel OpenVINO inference in an event-driven architecture."
keywords:
  - "zebrafish"
  - "Danio rerio"
  - "animal tracking"
  - "behavioural analysis"
  - "computer vision"
  - "YOLOv11"
  - "ByteTrack"
  - "OpenVINO"
  - "closed-loop stimulation"
  - "open-source software"
